                <mxCell id="n2" value="&lt;b&gt;EventEmitter&lt;/b&gt; holds &lt;i&gt;window_&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;descriptor_&lt;/i&gt; by&lt;br/&gt;pointer/reference (association, not ownership) —&lt;br/&gt;the window owns the emitter, not the reverse." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#f9a825;fontColor=#f57f17;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
